guarantee: AC-5: CallId refuses a `-` suffix without digits
file: crates/voicen-core/src/call/events.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
        Some((b'-', n)) if !n.is_empty() && n.iter().all(u8::is_ascii_digit) => Some(()),
--- new
